\n.ai-team/runs/universal-tool-sanitizer-20261030/architecture/architecture-packet.json:15:      \\\"verification_ids\\\": [\\\"VER-001\\\", \\\"VER-004\\\"]\\n.ai-team/runs/universal-tool-sanitizer-20261030/architecture/architecture-packet.json:21:      \\\"verification_ids\\\": [\\\"VER-002\\\", \\\"VER-003\\\"]\\n.ai-team/runs/universal-tool-sanitizer-20261030/architecture/architecture-packet.json:27:      \\\"verification_ids\\\": [\\\"VER-002\\\"]\\n.ai-team/runs/universal-tool-sanitizer-20261030/architecture/architecture-packet.json:33:      \\\"verification_ids\\\": [\\\"VER-002\\\"]\\n.ai-team/runs/universal-tool-sanitizer-20261030/architecture/architecture-packet.json:39:      \\\"verification_ids\\\": [\\\"VER-003\\\", \\\"VER-005\\\"]\\n.ai-team/runs/universal-tool-sanitizer-20261030/architecture/architecture-packet.json:56:      \\\"verification_ids\\\": [\\\"VER-002\\\"]\\n.ai-team/runs/universal-tool-sanitizer-20261030/architecture/architecture-packet.json:70:      \\\"verification_ids\\\": [\\\"VER-003\\\", \\\"VER-005\\\"]\\n.ai-team/runs/universal-tool-sanitizer-20261030/architecture/architecture-packet.json:84:      \\\"verification_ids\\\": [\\\"VER-001\\\", \\\"VER-004\\\"]\\ntests/test_agy_bridge_resilience.py:3845:    \\\"\\\"\\\"AD-005: локальный GigaRC-совместимый снимок, env > JSON bool > False (VER-005).\\\"\\\"\\\"\\ntests/test_agy_bridge_resilience.py:4030:# ---- арбитр planner-контента (AD-001, VER-001) -----------------------------------------\\ntests/test_agy_bridge_resilience.py:4194:    \\\"\\\"\\\"AD-001: двухуровневый арбитр без потерь и дублей (VER-001).\\\"\\\"\\\"\\ntests/test_agy_bridge_resilience.py:4433:# ---- безопасный прогресс инструментов (AD-002, VER-002) --------------------------------\\ntests/test_agy_bridge_resilience.py:4651:# ---- таймауты по активности producer (AD-003, VER-003) ---------------------------------\\ntests/test_agy_bridge_resilience.py:5249:# ---- graceful timeout (AD-004, VER-004) -------------------------------------------------\\ntests/test_agy_bridge_resilience.py:8647:    \\\"\\\"\\\"VER-001/VER-006 (USG-01..USG-05, USG-16): счётчики шагов хода из транскрипта.\\\"\\\"\\\"\\ntests/test_agy_bridge_resilience.py:9082:    \\\"\\\"\\\"VER-003 (USG-09..USG-12): ограниченный fallback и result-only ветка.\\\"\\\"\\\"\\ntests/test_agy_bridge_resilience.py:9377:    \\\"\\\"\\\"VER-002 (USG-06..USG-08): JSON и SSE с fake agy, один итоговый usage.\\\"\\\"\\\"\\ntests/test_agy_bridge_resilience.py:9553:    \\\"\\\"\\\"VER-004 (USG-13/USG-14): пятый флаг step_scoped_usage_enabled.\\\"\\\"\\\"\\ntests/test_context_resilience_routing.py:1:\\\"\\\"\\\"VER-004 (automated part): маршрутизация запроса через хаб :9882 с fake-droid.\\ntests/test_context_resilience_routing.py:3:Реальный bundled-bili spike (VER-004 PRE-CORE) этим модулем НЕ заменяется: здесь только\\ntests/test_context_resilience.py:1:\\\"\\\"\\\"VER-001 / VER-002: бюджет, граница B-1/B/B+1, якоря, неделимость, маркер 8, одна сериализация.\\ntests/test_context_resilience.py:96:    \\\"\\\"\\\"VER-001: C-R-H-S-1 / 0 / +1.\\\"\\\"\\\"\\ntests/test_context_resilience_switching.py:1:\\\"\\\"\\\"VER-005: динамическая смена целевых окон Argon 1M → Wonder 400k → Claude 200k → Argon 1M.\\ntests/test_context_resilience_protocols.py:1:\\\"\\\"\\\"VER-003: роли, чередование, reasoning/signature, заголовок X-DSH-Context-Pruned по протоколам.\\n\",\n  \"original_output_bytes\": 16004,\n  \"original_output_tokens\": 4001,\n  \"truncated\": false\n}","correlation_facts":{"tool_name":"bash","outcome":"success"}}}
